<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Redirecting...</title>
    <script>
        // 動態計算當前路徑的資料夾根目錄，完美適配本地端與 GitHub Pages 子路徑
        var basePath = window.location.pathname.substring(0, window.location.pathname.lastIndexOf('/') + 1);
        var targetUrl = basePath + 'Schedule.html';
        
        // 執行跳轉
        window.location.replace(targetUrl);
    </script>
</head>
<body>
    <p>正在前往行程表，若未自動跳轉請點擊 <script>document.write('<a href="' + basePath + 'Schedule.html">這裡</a>');</script>。</p>
</body>
</html>